Third-party material

syncro-pcb-lib/ is generated from the project's parts library (see
syncro-pcb-lib/GENERATED.md). Most of it is this project's own work, drawn from
vendor datasheet land patterns. These parts derive from the KiCad libraries and
stay under their licence, CC-BY-SA-4.0 WITH KiCad-libraries-exception:

- Symbol: ECMF02-2AMX6
- Footprint: JST_SH_SM04B-SRSS-TB
- Footprint: MikroBUS_Socket_2x1x08
- Footprint: USB_C_Receptacle_SHOUHAN_TYPE-C-16PIN-2MD-073
- Footprint: WSON-6-1EP_2x2mm_P0.65mm_EP1x1.6mm_ThermalVias_0.3mm

The libraries exception means a design that uses these parts is not required to
be released under CC-BY-SA.
